    "story": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "ratio": "tall",
        "flip": true,
        "eyebrow": "Made by hand",
        "heading": "It starts with one silly drawing",
        "text": "<p>A duck in a bucket hat. A mushroom having a lie-down. A snail who is, frankly, going through something. Whatever it is, it gets drawn first and justified later.</p><p>The ones that make me laugh become a sticker. Then a print. Then a keyring. Then, occasionally, a whole category.</p>",
        "cta_label": "See everything",
        "cta_link": "/collections/everything",
        "band": "green"
      }
    },
    "quotes": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "The sticker quality is genuinely absurd. Mine has been through the dishwasher on a water bottle and has not budged.",
            "author": "Rosie"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "Bought the duck print as a gift and immediately had to order a second one for myself. Entirely predictable.",
            "author": "Alex"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "Arrived in three days wrapped like a little present. The frog keyring lives on my keys now and I check on it.",
            "author": "Mina"
          }
        }
      },
